{
  "_meta": {
    "artifact": "SCP-G5-C-01 \u2014 Freshline Tenant Configuration v2 (R18 retirement)",
    "purpose": "Configuration version 2. Retires R18 by removing every value the canonical SCP market plane already owns. The tenant plane now REFERENCES the canonical market and states one bounded approved override; the runtime resolves a single effective configuration from the two. A duplicate authoritative value is no longer merely rejected \u2014 schema v2 makes it unrepresentable.",
    "ccSuppliedValues": [
      "planes.CATALOGUE.services[].durationMinutes \u2014 NOT present in the accepted-behavior freeze. SCP exclusive-capacity semantics cannot function without a duration, and the G5-B contract directs that service duration defaults be resolved here (G5A-G09). These are engineering defaults chosen to be internally consistent with the price ladder, NOT confirmed business facts, and MUST be confirmed by a human before Freshline transacts against them.",
      "planes.CATALOGUE.extras[].extraDurationMinutes \u2014 same status and same caveat.",
      "planes.CATALOGUE.*.active \u2014 the freeze requires active/inactive state to be configurable but did not state values; all catalogue items are set active, matching current Freshline operation.",
      "planes.MARKET.supportedLocales / localeDefault \u2014 normalized to the freeze's 'en' default with 'id' supported.",
      "planes.MARKET.approvedOverrides.operatingHours \u2014 the 08:00 opening carried forward from v1 as an EXPLICIT, BOUNDED override of the canonical 09:00. Preserved rather than silently dropped because it was in the accepted-behavior freeze, but it is now visibly a divergence requiring human ratification rather than an invisible duplicate."
    ],
    "notCarriedForward": [
      "planes.MARKET.timezone, planes.MARKET.currency and planes.MARKET.operatingHours are REMOVED. The canonical SCP market configuration (config/bali.market.json) owns them. In v1 they were restated here and had already drifted: Core declared a 09:00 opening while this bundle declared 08:00 \u2014 two independently authoritative values for one runtime semantic, which is exactly what R18 named.",
      "planes.COMMERCE.payment.currencies.priceCurrency and displayCurrency are REMOVED. They are derived from the canonical market currency at resolution time. Only the payment-specific chargeCurrency and settlementCurrency remain, both null while payment is inactive."
    ]
  },
